# Private news capture credentials. Copy outside the repository/web export.
# Suggested location: D:/Personal/fpl-operations/news/.env
# Fill locally. Never commit, upload or paste the real values in chat.
# One literal KEY=value per line; optional matching single/double quotes.
# Comments occupy their own line. No interpolation, multiline or inline comments.
# Existing process environment values take precedence, including empty values.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional: leave blank for FPL-only news translation.
X_BEARER_TOKEN=
